                <pb facs="0134" n="46" xml:id="pg46"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Storer.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-04-29"><hi rendition="#italic">April 29,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay instructs Mr. Storer to request permission for a fleet of nine American
                    naval vessels to make a friendly visit to Austro-Hungarian waters and to the
                    port of Trieste.)</p>
            </div>
